# Anchored with a leading slash: the runtime upload directory is /storage at the repo root.
# Unanchored, `storage/` matches at ANY depth, which also swallowed src/lib/storage/ — 330
# lines of real attachment-handling source that were therefore never committed, so CI could
# not compile the project at all (TS2307: cannot find module '@/lib/storage/local').
/storage/
!/storage/.gitkeep
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.playwright-mcp/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
coverage/
